The cause is in the server component `app/members/[id]/page.tsx`: `<Anchor component={Link}>` passes the `Link` function as a prop to a Mantine client component, and functions can't cross that boundary. The fix is to wrap the back link and the avatar in small client components.

I also dropped `Group component="span"` there and used a plain flex span. In `team-view.tsx`, which is already a client component, `Anchor component={Link}` is fine and stays as it was.

